    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/1705.04554v1</id>
    <title>Some results of strongly primitive tensors</title>
    <updated>2017-05-12T13:10:30Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1705.04554v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/1705.04554v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>In this paper, we show that an order $m$ dimension 2 tensor is primitive if and only if its majorization matrix is primitive, and then we obtain the characterization of order $m$ dimension 2 strongly primitive tensors and the bound of the strongly primitive degree. Furthermore, we study the properties of strongly primitive tensors with $n\geq 3$, and propose some problems for further research.</summary>
